{title: Caracas se quema}
{artist: Autopista Sur}
{year: 2008}
{key: E}
{time: 4/4}

{define: A base-fret 1 frets 2 1 0 0}
{define: Amaj7 base-fret 1 frets 1 1 0 0}
{define: E base-fret 1 frets 4 4 4 2}
{define: F#m base-fret 1 frets 2 1 2 0}
{define: B base-fret 1 frets 4 3 2 2}
{define: C#m7 base-fret 1 frets 4 4 4 4}
{define: G#m base-fret 1 frets 4 3 4 2}

{start_of_verse: Intro}
[A]· · [Amaj7]·     · | [E]· · · · | [A]· · [Amaj7]·     · | [F#m]·   · · · | [F#m]·   · · ·
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verso 1}
La tem[E]peratu[A]ra de nue[F#m]vo subió[B]  [B]
Aquí no hay[E] un invier[A]no que enga[F#m]ñe al sol[B]  [B]
Sin embar[E]go las co[A]sas funcio[F#m]nan igual[B]  [B]
Con la gra[E]sa que bro[A]ta de la[F#m] capital[B]  [B]
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verso 2}
Escena[E]rio de acto[A]res de tra[F#m]je y carmín[B]  [B]
En un jue[E]go de dar[A]dos que no[F#m] tiene fin[B]  [B]
Ya las som[E]bras indi[A]can que el sol[F#m] se marchó[B]  [B]
Los leo[E]nes de no[C#m7]che no tie[A]nen color[B]  [B]
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Pre-coro}
Vas a ver[A] · [Amaj7] · | [E] · ·Vas a · ver | [A] · [Amaj7] · | [F#m] · · · | [F#m] · · ·
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Coro}
[B] Al[C#m7]gunos [E]dicen [F#m]ver las [A]llamas [B]al bai[G#m]lar [G#m]
[B] Y es [C#m7]que Ca[E]racas [F#m]si que [A] se quema [B]de verdad[E] · · · | [E] · · ·
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Instrumental (Swing)}
